     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bathroom/how-to/how-to-plan-a-bathroom-remodel-in-5-steps-pub6df56468",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "如何分五步规划浴室改造",
     "text": "从洗脸池柜、壁柜到照明和镜子，了解在改造或翻新浴室时你需要考虑哪些因素。",
     "image": "https://content-service-oss.aidesign.ingka-internal.cn/content-hub/f96ef328-1efa-4dd7-befb-0fa4910a9d15/9d672027-4f85-4589-a69f-9ba8215021ff.jpeg",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bathroom/how-to/how-to-design-a-bathroom-in-5-steps-pub2bd2f96d",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "如何为浴室照明",
     "text": "需要帮忙挑选新的浴室照明设备？以下几条指导建议可助你提升浴室照明的功能性、灵活性和舒适性。立即在线下单或前往宜家商场选购！",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/c3/cc/c3cc97e29c819824ba8c4661aae2e6f1.jpg",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bathroom/how-to/bathroom-lighting-ideas-to-brighten-each-moment-puba572ecfd",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "如何设计一个趣味十足的家庭浴室",
     "text": "想要寻找兼具趣味和风格的浴室家具及配件？为毛巾、玩具和其他物品挑选富有创意的收纳方案。立即选购。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/b2/18/b218142d754ecb4f7e227c6a0c39482f.jpg",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bathroom/how-to/3-ways-to-make-your-bathroom-work-for-all-ages-pub4d89f9cf",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "浴室节水的六个创意",
     "text": "只要有合适的装备并养成一些新习惯，浴室节水很容易。以下这些实用的技巧可以帮助你快速上手。立即在线下单或前往宜家商场选购！",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/c6/ec/c6ec9e24f7905b25838dc630bb350226.jpg",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bathroom/how-to/easy-water-saving-tips-in-the-bathroom-pub890766d0",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "用纺织品装点浴室",
     "text": "一起看看下面这些简便的浴室装饰创意，借助纺织品打造完全不同的风格。浏览页面获取灵感，立即在线下单或前往宜家商场选购！",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/dd/29/dd2979bbde9788f9882e7b36690cae57.jpg",
     "href": "/cn/zh/rooms/bathroom/how-to/3-bathroom-decorating-ideas-the-power-of-textiles-puba566360e",
     "backgroundColor": null
    },
    {
     "title": "焕新浴室，享受更智能的生活",
     "text": "浴室是你的温暖港湾。添置这些设计时尚、功能实用、价格实惠的环保新产品，焕新你的浴室。可到宜家商场购买，或在线下单。",
